<title>UK: BOE allots 1.13 billion stg in repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 1.13 billion stg in repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it allotted 1.13 billion stg to the UK money market in 6.5 percent repos to July 3 and 4 after forecasting a liquidity shortage of 1.45 billion.</p>
</text>
